# What engine.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that runs
# this tool. init.lua passes the resolved path in, it never runs it.
# Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Olm's lib/deps.lua for the kinds and for how these files are found.
# Name a tool only, never how to install it. That belongs to the layer above.
displayplacer | path | displayplacer | optional | reading and applying display arrangements
